what: operator's question 2026-09-15 ("what about !.Effect beside
  okay.Effect"): the `!.Effect` alias of Free.Inject (type + val) goes,
  every `Effect(e)` pattern and constructor in the 21 files that use it
  becomes `Inject(e)`, and `derives okay.Effect` can be `derives Effect`
